title: The Left Breaks Away
subtitle: Ruth Fischer and Arkadi Maslow will not accept Levi's party.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month >= 9 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and e21_left_split_pending = 1 and left_split = 0 and offensive_gone = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 9
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_left_split_pending = 0;
RG.news('Berlin opposition conference: the Left threatens to leave the party', 3);
!}

= The Left Breaks Away

Since Jena the Berlin district has refused to distribute the Rote Fahne's articles on the united front. In September Ruth Fischer and Arkadi Maslow call a conference of the opposition. Berlin comes, and parts of Hamburg, the Ruhr and the Palatinate. The party has become a second USPD under Levi, they say, and the revolutionaries must keep the International's flag flying in Germany, alone if need be.

The KAPD has already offered them a home. Zinoviev has not decided whose side he is on.

- @let_go: Let them go.
- @leaders: Expel Fischer and Maslow, and keep their members.
- @offer: Offer the Left seats in the Zentrale.

@let_go
subtitle: The Left's districts leave with them, and what remains is of one mind.
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_split = 1;
Q.offensive_gone = 1;
var heir = (Q.leading_faction == 'offensive') ? 'unionist' : Q.leading_faction;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] == 'offensive') {
        Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.5;
        Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] = heir;
        Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] = 50;
    }
}
Q.offensive_satisfaction = 0;
if (Q.junior_faction == 'offensive') {
    Q.junior_faction = 0;
}
Q.kapd_exists = 1;
Q.unity += 12;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -8);
!}

The opposition walks out and founds a Communist Left, and within weeks it is talking about fusion with the KAPD. Half the members in the Left's districts go with it.

@leaders
subtitle: A smaller split, and a bitter one. Most of the Left's members stay, and they do not forget.
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_split = 1;
RG.district('berlin', {members: -0.2, loyalty: -10});
if (Q.comrade_fischer == 1 || Q.comrade_fischer == 2) { RG.expel('fischer', {news: 'Ruth Fischer expelled from the party', priority: 2}); }
if (Q.comrade_maslow == 1 || Q.comrade_maslow == 2 || Q.comrade_maslow == 3) { RG.expel('maslow', {quiet: true}); }
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 20;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -6);
RG.ledger('Ruth Fischer and Arkadi Maslow were expelled, and part of Berlin went with them.', 'e21_fischer_expelled');
!}

The Zentrale expels Fischer, Maslow and a dozen of their lieutenants. Part of Berlin goes with them.

@offer
subtitle: No split. The Left joins the Zentrale, and the united front will be applied "from below".
on-arrival: {!
Q.junior_faction = 'offensive';
RG.setRole('fischer', 'Zentrale; leader of the Left');
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 20;
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 8;
!}

At the last moment the Zentrale offers the opposition three seats. Fischer accepts, and tells her friends that it is a truce.
